/**
 * =============================================================
 *  INTERFACE: Rateable
 * =============================================================
 *
 *  OOP CONCEPTS DEMONSTRATED:
 *  - Interface                  : contract for any "rateable" entity
 *  - Multiple Interface Usage   : Driver implements BOTH User inheritance
 *                                  AND this interface simultaneously
 *
 *  Used by the Driver class so passengers can rate drivers
 *  after completing a ride (as instructed by the professor).
 * =============================================================
 */
public interface Rateable {

    /**
     * Add a new rating (should be between 1.0 and 5.0).
     */
    void addRating(double rating);

    /**
     * Return the average of all ratings received so far.
     */
    double getAverageRating();
}
